# sia/

The `sia/` module orchestrates Riffle's pattern layer -- a staged pipeline that applies sense-infer-act logic to streaming data. It bridges the impure predicate engine with the pure waist via typed perturbations, threading context and emissions through configurable loop stages. The default pipeline bundles signal detection, inference rules, and action predicates.

## Files

- `sia.ex` -- THE pattern layer; orchestrates staged runs with typed perturbations, threading context and emissions through pipeline loops
- `pipelines.ex` -- Pipeline source vocabulary and resolution; fetches from modules, files, structs, or default configuration
- `default_pipeline.ex` -- Default sense-infer-act definitions; signal detection, inference rules, and action predicates with signal loop
